          <div class="font-semibold text-sm mb-1 flex items-center gap-2" id="compliance-title">
            <span>Statutory Guidance</span>
          </div>
          <p id="compliance-text" class="text-muted"></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- SEO In-Depth Editorial Guide -->
    <article class="prose prose-neutral dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-[15px] leading-relaxed mt-16 pt-12 border-t border-base">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-base mb-6">How the Old vs New GST Rate Comparison Works</h2>
      
      <p>
        Under the Indian Goods and Services Tax (GST) framework governed by the Central Goods and Services Tax (CGST) Act, 2017 and respective State GST acts, tax rates on commodities and services undergo periodic rationalization through GST Council recommendations and CBIC notifications. When a rate revision takes effect, manufacturers, distributors, retailers, and service providers must immediately recalibrate their pricing structures, Point of Sale (POS) systems, and ERP billing masters.
      </p>

      <p>
        Our <strong>Old vs New GST Rate Comparison Tool</strong> provides an automated mathematical breakdown of price shifts, tax variations, and consumer savings across legacy and rationalized GST slabs.
      </p>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-base mt-8 mb-4">1. Mathematical Formulas for Tax and Price Variance</h3>
      <p>Depending on whether your business operates on backward tax-inclusive MRP pricing or forward base pricing, two core formulas determine the outcome:</p>
      
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Forward Base Pricing (Standard B2B):</strong>
          <div class="my-2 p-3 bg-subtle rounded-lg font-mono text-xs">
            Old Tax = Base Price × (Old Rate ÷ 100)<br />
            New Tax = Base Price × (New Rate ÷ 100)<br />
            Net Tax Variance (ΔTax) = New Tax − Old Tax<br />
            Revised Retail Price = Base Price + New Tax
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Backward MRP Extraction (Packaged Goods / Retail):</strong>
          <div class="my-2 p-3 bg-subtle rounded-lg font-mono text-xs">
            Extracted Base Price = Original MRP ÷ (1 + Old Rate ÷ 100)<br />
            Revised Mandatory MRP = Extracted Base Price × (1 + New Rate ÷ 100)
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-base mt-8 mb-4">2. Section 171 Anti-Profiteering Mandate</h3>
      <p>
        A critical legal dimension of any downward GST rate revision is compliance with <strong>Section 171 of the CGST Act</strong>. The law strictly mandates that:
      </p>
      <blockquote>
        "Any reduction in rate of tax on any supply of goods or services or the benefit of input tax credit shall be passed on to the recipient by way of commensurate reduction in prices."
      </blockquote>
      <p>
        If a product previously taxed at 12% is reclassified to 5%, the seller cannot pocket the 7% tax differential by keeping the customer-facing MRP unchanged while pocketing extra profit. Anti-profiteering complaints are investigated under the jurisdiction of the Competition Commission of India (CCI), and non-compliant suppliers can be ordered to refund excess amounts with 18% statutory interest, pay heavy penalties, or face business deregistration.
      </p>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-base mt-8 mb-4">3. Transitory Invoicing Rules under Section 14 (Time of Supply)</h3>
      <p>
        When tax rates change mid-month, determining whether an invoice should reflect the old or new rate depends on <strong>Section 14 of the CGST Act</strong>. The applicable rate is determined by the intersection of three pivotal operational events:
      </p>
      <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-2">
        <li><strong>Date of Supply of Goods or Services</strong></li>
        <li><strong>Date of Issue of Invoice</strong></li>
        <li><strong>Date of Receipt of Payment (Bank credit or book entry)</strong></li>
      </ol>
      <p>
        As a general legal standard, whichever two of these three events occur after the rate change date will dictate the applicable rate. For example, if goods were dispatched prior to the rate change, but both the invoice was issued and payment was credited into the bank account after the rate change, the <em>new</em> rate applies.
      </p>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-base mt-8 mb-4">4. Impact of Rate Revisions on Input Tax Credit (ITC)</h3>
      <p>
        Rate changes also have direct consequences for input tax recovery:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Movement between taxable slabs (e.g. 18% to 5%):</strong> Does not require any retrospective reversal of ITC claimed on raw materials or capital goods purchased at earlier higher rates.</li>
        <li><strong>Movement to Exempt (0%):</strong> Triggers mandatory reversal of ITC on inputs and stock on hand under Section 18(4) and Rule 42 of the CGST Rules.</li>
        <li><strong>Inverted Duty Structure:</strong> Where the output rate drops below the tax rate on raw materials (e.g., input fabric at 12% and output garments at 5%), manufacturers become entitled to file for an Inverted Duty Structure refund under Section 54(3)(ii).</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-base mt-8 mb-4">5. Retail Relabeling &amp; Legal Metrology Rules</h3>
      <p>
        Under the Legal Metrology (Packaged Commodities) Rules, retailers are legally prohibited from selling packaged commodities at a price higher than the printed MRP. Following GST rate reductions, the Department of Consumer Affairs traditionally permits manufacturers, packers, and importers to declare revised lower MRPs on unsold pre-packaged stock via stamped, stickered, or online printed tags, provided the original MRP remains visible.
      </p>
    </article>

    <!-- Related Tools & Guides -->
    <div class="border-t border-base pt-12 mt-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-base mb-6">Related GST Rate &amp; Pricing Tools</h2>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <a href="/gst-rate-finder/" class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-base bg-surface hover:border-accent hover:shadow-sm transition-all group">
          <div class="font-semibold text-base group-hover:text-accent flex items-center gap-1.5">
            GST Rate Finder →
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1">Search HSN and SAC codes with verified current GST rates across all commodities.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/mrp-revision-calculator/" class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-base bg-surface hover:border-accent hover:shadow-sm transition-all group">
          <div class="font-semibold text-base group-hover:text-accent flex items-center gap-1.5">
            MRP Revision Calculator →
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1">Compute exact revised packaging sticker MRPs after GST rate adjustments to preserve margins.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/hsn-code-lookup/" class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-base bg-surface hover:border-accent hover:shadow-sm transition-all group">
          <div class="font-semibold text-base group-hover:text-accent flex items-center gap-1.5">
            HSN &amp; SAC Code Lookup →
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1">Find 4, 6, and 8-digit HSN codes, chapter descriptions, and statutory applicability.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/gst-calculator" class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-base bg-surface hover:border-accent hover:shadow-sm transition-all group">
          <div class="font-semibold text-base group-hover:text-accent flex items-center gap-1.5">
            GST Inclusive/Exclusive Calculator →
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1">Add or remove GST with split CGST, SGST, and IGST breakdowns.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/invoice-generator" class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-base bg-surface hover:border-accent hover:shadow-sm transition-all group">
          <div class="font-semibold text-base group-hover:text-accent flex items-center gap-1.5">
            GST Invoice Generator →
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1">Generate compliant PDF invoices with custom rates and automatic tax calculation.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/aggregate-turnover-calculator" class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-base bg-surface hover:border-accent hover:shadow-sm transition-all group">
          <div class="font-semibold text-base group-hover:text-accent flex items-center gap-1.5">
            Aggregate Turnover Calculator →
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1">Check PAN-wide turnover for GST registration, composition, and QRMP thresholds.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- FAQ Section -->
    <section class="border-t border-base pt-12 pb-20 mt-16" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
      <h2 id="faq-heading" class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-base mb-2">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <p class="text-muted text-[15px] mb-8">Comprehensive answers regarding GST rate revisions, pricing formulas, and anti-profiteering compliance.</p>
      
      <div class="space-y-3">
        {faqs.map((faq, i) => (
          <details class="group rounded-xl border border-base bg-surface overflow-hidden" id={`faq-grc-${i}`}>
            <summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-4 font-medium text-base hover:bg-subtle transition-colors list-none">
              <span class="text-[15px]">{faq.q}</span>
              <svg class="h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-muted group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <div class="px-6 pb-5 text-[14px] text-muted leading-relaxed border-t border-base pt-4">
              {faq.a}
            </div>
          </details>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  let pricingMode = 'base'; // 'base' | 'mrp'

  const priceInput = document.getElementById('price-input') as HTMLInputElement;
  const priceLabel = document.getElementById('price-label')!;
  const priceHint = document.getElementById('price-hint')!;
  const modeBaseBtn = document.getElementById('mode-base')!;
  const modeMrpBtn = document.getElementById('mode-mrp')!;
  const supplyTypeSelect = document.getElementById('supply-type') as HTMLSelectElement;

  const oldRateSelect = document.getElementById('old-rate') as HTMLSelectElement;
  const oldCustomInput = document.getElementById('old-custom-rate') as HTMLInputElement;
  const newRateSelect = document.getElementById('new-rate') as HTMLSelectElement;
  const newCustomInput = document.getElementById('new-custom-rate') as HTMLInputElement;

  // Badges
  const oldRateBadge = document.getElementById('old-rate-badge')!;
  const newRateBadge = document.getElementById('new-rate-badge')!;

  // Old Card Elements
  const oldBaseEl = document.getElementById('old-base')!;
  const oldTaxTotalEl = document.getElementById('old-tax-total')!;
  const oldTotalEl = document.getElementById('old-total')!;
  const oldCgstRow = document.getElementById('old-cgst-row')!;
  const oldSgstRow = document.getElementById('old-sgst-row')!;
  const oldIgstRow = document.getElementById('old-igst-row')!;
  const oldCgstPct = document.getElementById('old-cgst-pct')!;
  const oldSgstPct = document.getElementById('old-sgst-pct')!;
  const oldIgstPct = document.getElementById('old-igst-pct')!;
  const oldCgstVal = document.getElementById('old-cgst-val')!;
  const oldSgstVal = document.getElementById('old-sgst-val')!;
  const oldIgstVal = document.getElementById('old-igst-val')!;

  // New Card Elements
  const newBaseEl = document.getElementById('new-base')!;
  const newTaxTotalEl = document.getElementById('new-tax-total')!;
  const newTotalEl = document.getElementById('new-total')!;
  const newCgstRow = document.getElementById('new-cgst-row')!;
  const newSgstRow = document.getElementById('new-sgst-row')!;
  const newIgstRow = document.getElementById('new-igst-row')!;
  const newCgstPct = document.getElementById('new-cgst-pct')!;
  const newSgstPct = document.getElementById('new-sgst-pct')!;
  const newIgstPct = document.getElementById('new-igst-pct')!;
  const newCgstVal = document.getElementById('new-cgst-val')!;
  const newSgstVal = document.getElementById('new-sgst-val')!;
  const newIgstVal = document.getElementById('new-igst-val')!;

  // Impact Card
  const impactCard = document.getElementById('impact-card')!;
  const impactVal = document.getElementById('impact-val')!;
  const impactDesc = document.getElementById('impact-desc')!;
  const complianceBanner = document.getElementById('compliance-banner')!;
  const complianceTitle = document.getElementById('compliance-title')!;
  const complianceText = document.getElementById('compliance-text')!;

  function formatINR(val: number) {
    const rounded = Math.round(val * 100) / 100;
    return '₹' + rounded.toLocaleString('en-IN', { minimumFractionDigits: 2, maximumFractionDigits: 2 });
  }

  function getRate(selectEl: HTMLSelectElement, customInput: HTMLInputElement): number {
    if (selectEl.value === 'custom') {
      return parseFloat(customInput.value) || 0;
    }
    return parseFloat(selectEl.value) || 0;
  }

  function setPricingMode(mode: 'base' | 'mrp') {
    pricingMode = mode;
    if (mode === 'base') {
      modeBaseBtn.className = 'px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md font-medium bg-surface text-base shadow-sm transition-all';
      modeMrpBtn.className = 'px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md font-medium text-muted hover:text-base transition-all';
      priceLabel.textContent = 'Base Price (Excluding Tax)';
      priceHint.textContent = 'Net supplier price before applying any GST.';
    } else {
      modeMrpBtn.className = 'px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md font-medium bg-surface text-base shadow-sm transition-all';
      modeBaseBtn.className = 'px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md font-medium text-muted hover:text-base transition-all';
      priceLabel.textContent = 'Old MRP (Tax-Inclusive Price)';
      priceHint.textContent = 'Current retail sticker price. Tool will extract base price and compute revised MRP.';
    }
    calculate();
  }

  function calculate() {
    const rawPrice = parseFloat(priceInput.value) || 0;
    const oldRate = getRate(oldRateSelect, oldCustomInput);
    const newRate = getRate(newRateSelect, newCustomInput);
    const isInterState = supplyTypeSelect.value === 'inter';

    oldRateBadge.textContent = `${oldRate}% GST`;
    newRateBadge.textContent = `${newRate}% GST`;

    let basePrice = 0;
    let oldTaxAmount = 0;
    let oldTotalAmount = 0;
    let newTaxAmount = 0;
    let newTotalAmount = 0;

    if (pricingMode === 'base') {
      basePrice = rawPrice;
      oldTaxAmount = basePrice * (oldRate / 100);
      oldTotalAmount = basePrice + oldTaxAmount;

      newTaxAmount = basePrice * (newRate / 100);
      newTotalAmount = basePrice + newTaxAmount;
    } else {
      // MRP Mode: rawPrice is old MRP
      oldTotalAmount = rawPrice;
      basePrice = oldRate > 0 ? oldTotalAmount / (1 + oldRate / 100) : oldTotalAmount;
      oldTaxAmount = oldTotalAmount - basePrice;

      newTaxAmount = basePrice * (newRate / 100);
      newTotalAmount = basePrice + newTaxAmount;
    }

    // Populate Old Scenario
    oldBaseEl.textContent = formatINR(basePrice);
    oldTaxTotalEl.textContent = formatINR(oldTaxAmount);
    oldTotalEl.textContent = formatINR(oldTotalAmount);

    if (isInterState) {
      oldCgstRow.classList.add('hidden');
      oldSgstRow.classList.add('hidden');
      oldIgstRow.classList.remove('hidden');
      oldIgstPct.textContent = `${oldRate}%`;
      oldIgstVal.textContent = formatINR(oldTaxAmount);
    } else {
      oldCgstRow.classList.remove('hidden');
      oldSgstRow.classList.remove('hidden');
      oldIgstRow.classList.add('hidden');
      const halfRate = oldRate / 2;
      const halfTax = oldTaxAmount / 2;
      oldCgstPct.textContent = `${halfRate}%`;
      oldSgstPct.textContent = `${halfRate}%`;
      oldCgstVal.textContent = formatINR(halfTax);
      oldSgstVal.textContent = formatINR(halfTax);
    }

    // Populate New Scenario
    newBaseEl.textContent = formatINR(basePrice);
    newTaxTotalEl.textContent = formatINR(newTaxAmount);
    newTotalEl.textContent = formatINR(newTotalAmount);

    if (isInterState) {
      newCgstRow.classList.add('hidden');
      newSgstRow.classList.add('hidden');
      newIgstRow.classList.remove('hidden');
      newIgstPct.textContent = `${newRate}%`;
      newIgstVal.textContent = formatINR(newTaxAmount);
    } else {
      newCgstRow.classList.remove('hidden');
      newSgstRow.classList.remove('hidden');
      newIgstRow.classList.add('hidden');
      const halfRate = newRate / 2;
      const halfTax = newTaxAmount / 2;
      newCgstPct.textContent = `${halfRate}%`;
      newSgstPct.textContent = `${halfRate}%`;
      newCgstVal.textContent = formatINR(halfTax);
      newSgstVal.textContent = formatINR(halfTax);
    }

    // Difference calculations
    const priceDiff = newTotalAmount - oldTotalAmount;
    const taxDiff = newTaxAmount - oldTaxAmount;
    const absPriceDiff = Math.abs(priceDiff);

    if (priceDiff < -0.01) {
      // Tax decreased (Consumer saving)
      const savingPct = oldTotalAmount > 0 ? (absPriceDiff / oldTotalAmount) * 100 : 0;
      impactCard.className = 'rounded-2xl border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-50/40 dark:bg-emerald-950/20 p-6 sm:p-8 text-center shadow-sm';
      impactVal.className = 'text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-mono font-bold my-2 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400';
      impactVal.textContent = `- ${formatINR(absPriceDiff)} (${savingPct.toFixed(2)}% drop)`;
      impactDesc.textContent = `Consumer savings of ${formatINR(absPriceDiff)} per unit. Tax drops by ${formatINR(Math.abs(taxDiff))}.`;

      complianceBanner.className = 'mt-6 rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-500/10 p-4 text-left text-xs leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto';
      complianceTitle.innerHTML = '⚖️ Section 171 Anti-Profiteering Action Required';
      complianceTitle.className = 'font-semibold text-sm mb-1 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300 flex items-center gap-2';
      complianceText.textContent = `Because GST decreased from ${oldRate}% to ${newRate}%, suppliers are legally required to reduce retail prices by at least ${formatINR(absPriceDiff)} to pass on the tax saving to consumers. Failure to reduce prices invites investigation from the Competition Commission of India.`;
    } else if (priceDiff > 0.01) {
      // Tax increased
      const increasePct = oldTotalAmount > 0 ? (absPriceDiff / oldTotalAmount) * 100 : 0;
      impactCard.className = 'rounded-2xl border border-rose-500/30 bg-rose-50/40 dark:bg-rose-950/20 p-6 sm:p-8 text-center shadow-sm';
      impactVal.className = 'text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-mono font-bold my-2 text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400';
      impactVal.textContent = `+ ${formatINR(absPriceDiff)} (+${increasePct.toFixed(2)}%)`;
      impactDesc.textContent = `Price increase of ${formatINR(absPriceDiff)} for the buyer. Tax increases by ${formatINR(taxDiff)}.`;

      complianceBanner.className = 'mt-6 rounded-xl border border-rose-500/30 bg-rose-500/10 p-4 text-left text-xs leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto';
      complianceTitle.innerHTML = '⚠️ ERP & Invoicing Action Required';
      complianceTitle.className = 'font-semibold text-sm mb-1 text-rose-700 dark:text-rose-300 flex items-center gap-2';
      complianceText.textContent = `With the GST rate jumping from ${oldRate}% to ${newRate}%, ensure your POS billing software, ERP tax ledgers, and price tags are updated immediately on the effective notification date. If goods were supplied prior to the change, verify Section 14 time of supply rules before billing.`;
    } else {
      // No Change
      impactCard.className = 'rounded-2xl border border-base bg-surface p-6 sm:p-8 text-center shadow-sm';
      impactVal.className = 'text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-mono font-bold my-2 text-base';
      impactVal.textContent = '₹0.00 (No Variance)';
      impactDesc.textContent = 'Both old and new rates produce an identical tax liability and retail price.';

      complianceBanner.className = 'mt-6 rounded-xl border border-base bg-subtle p-4 text-left text-xs leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto';
      complianceTitle.innerHTML = '✓ Neutral Rate Classification';
      complianceTitle.className = 'font-semibold text-sm mb-1 text-base flex items-center gap-2';
      complianceText.textContent = 'Tax liability remains unchanged. No retail price adjustments or ERP rate reconfigurations are required.';
    }
  }

  // Event Listeners
  modeBaseBtn.addEventListener('click', () => setPricingMode('base'));
  modeMrpBtn.addEventListener('click', () => setPricingMode('mrp'));
  priceInput.addEventListener('input', calculate);
  supplyTypeSelect.addEventListener('change', calculate);

  oldRateSelect.addEventListener('change', () => {
    if (oldRateSelect.value === 'custom') {
      oldCustomInput.disabled = false;
      oldCustomInput.classList.remove('opacity-50');
      oldCustomInput.focus();
    } else {
      oldCustomInput.disabled = true;
      oldCustomInput.classList.add('opacity-50');
      oldCustomInput.value = '';
    }
    calculate();
  });
  oldCustomInput.addEventListener('input', calculate);

  newRateSelect.addEventListener('change', () => {
    if (newRateSelect.value === 'custom') {
      newCustomInput.disabled = false;
      newCustomInput.classList.remove('opacity-50');
      newCustomInput.focus();
    } else {
      newCustomInput.disabled = true;
      newCustomInput.classList.add('opacity-50');
      newCustomInput.value = '';
    }
    calculate();
  });
  newCustomInput.addEventListener('input', calculate);

  // Preset Buttons
  document.querySelectorAll('.preset-btn').forEach((btn) => {
    btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const oldVal = (btn as HTMLElement).dataset.old || '12';
      const newVal = (btn as HTMLElement).dataset.new || '5';
      oldRateSelect.value = oldVal;
      oldCustomInput.disabled = true;
      oldCustomInput.classList.add('opacity-50');
      oldCustomInput.value = '';

      newRateSelect.value = newVal;
      newCustomInput.disabled = true;
      newCustomInput.classList.add('opacity-50');
      newCustomInput.value = '';

      calculate();
    });
  });

  // Initial calculation
  calculate();
</script>
